#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:115
msgid "Restrict media deletion"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:116
msgid "Non-administrators can only delete media library items they uploaded themselves. Without this, WordPress lets anyone who can upload files delete any attachment, regardless of who uploaded it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:119
msgid "Allow SVG uploads"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:120
msgid "Lets administrators upload SVG files through the Media Library — every file is sanitized (scripts, event handlers, and embedded HTML stripped) before it's stored."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:123
msgid "Disable generated image sizes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:124
msgid "Stops WordPress from generating its own default image sizes (thumbnail, medium, medium_large, large, 1536x1536, 2048x2048). Sizes a theme registers itself are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:149
msgid "Restrict site to logged-in users"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:153
msgid "Blocks every front-end page for logged-out visitors with a blank placeholder page — the WordPress admin and login screen stay reachable. Use this to preview a site privately before launch."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:163
msgid "Disable author archives"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:164
msgid "Redirects author archive pages to the homepage — mainly useful on single-author sites, or to avoid leaking usernames via author URLs."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:167
msgid "Disable blog posts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:168
msgid "For sites built from pages only. Posts, category, tag and date archives, and the RSS feeds return a 404 (then redirect to the homepage if \"Redirect 404 pages to the homepage\" is on), and posts are left out of the WordPress sitemap. Existing posts and the admin are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:171
msgid "Disable comments"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:172
msgid "Closes comments, pingbacks and trackbacks on all content regardless of each page's discussion settings, hides already approved comments, and turns the comment feeds into a 404."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:175
msgid "Redirect 404 pages to the homepage"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:176
msgid "Applies to logged-out visitors only. Turn off if this site should show a real 404 page instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:179
msgid "Disable site search"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:180
msgid "Turns the built-in WordPress search into a 404 for every visitor — useful while a site is still under construction and shouldn't expose a working search box yet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:183
msgid "Remove jQuery Migrate"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:184
msgid "Turn off if an older plugin or theme on this site depends on jQuery Migrate's compatibility shims."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Hardening/SettingsPage.php:242
msgid "Applies to both the WebP format conversion above and every automatically generated responsive image size (1–100)."
msgstr ""

